{"s":[[null,1,[["g",[["The_Mountain.thumb.webp",320,[],"The_Mountain.webp"]]],["p",["The Mountain is an exterior region in the northern part of Stardew Valley. Initially, there are only two exits: to the south leading to ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"],", and to the west leading to the ",["l","边远森林","Backwoods"],". However, over the course of the game, several events open up new routes:"]],["l",0,[[1,["On ",["l","春季","Spring"]," 5, debris blocking the bridge north of the lake is cleared, providing access to ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"],"."]],[1,["On ",["l","夏季","Summer"]," 3, an earthquake opens a pass north from the Mountain to the ",["l","铁路","Railroad"],"."]],[1,["The bridge leading to the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"]," at the east end of the map can be repaired (by completing all ",["l","收集包#Crafts Room","Crafts Room Bundles"]," or purchasing \"Bridge\" from the ",["l","Joja社区发展申请书","Joja Community Development Form"]," for 25,000g)."]],[1,["The Glittering Boulder blocking the water flow west of the mine entrance can be removed (by completing all ",["l","收集包#Fish Tank","Fish Tank Bundles"]," or purchasing \"Panning\" from the Joja Community Development Form for 20,000g)."]],[1,["After completing the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"]," or purchasing the ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"]," subscription for 5,000g you can purchase a \"",["l","木匠的商店#Community Upgrades","Community Upgrade"],"\" which will upgrade the ",["l","拖车","trailer"]," and open up some hidden passages. One will be located south of the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"]," and will lead to the river waterfall north of ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"],"."]]]]]],["Features",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Occupants"]}],[[["f","Carpenter's_Shop.png",200]],[["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]],["Located to the West, the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," is where ",["l","罗宾","Robin"]," runs her carpenter business. Her husband ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]," and children ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"]," and ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]," also live here in the attached house."],[["l","罗宾","Robin"],"\n",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],"\n",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]]],[[["f","Tent.png",64]],[["l","帐篷","Tent"]],["Northeast of the Carpenter's Shop; this is where ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"]," lives and spends much of his time."],[["l","莱纳斯","Linus"]]],[[["f","Treehouse_Exterior.png",150]],[["l","树屋","Treehouse"]],["Located on the Mountain, in a large tree east of the entrance of the Railroad, and west of Linus' tent. It is only available after reaching 6 hearts of ",["l","友谊","friendship"]," with ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],"."],[["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[[["f","MinesEntrance.png",200]],[["l","矿井","The Mines"]],["Beyond the lake lies the entrance to a monster infested mine that is the primary source of stone and ores for the town."],[["l","矮人","Dwarf"]]],[[["f","Adventurer's_Guild.gif",120]],[["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"]],["Further along the path from the mines, ",["l","马龙","Marlon"]," and ",["l","吉尔","Gil"]," reside here. Once access is gained, it provides a shop selling certain ",["l","武器","Weapons"],", ",["l","鞋类","Boots"],", and ",["l","戒指","Rings"],". It also provides rewards for slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"],"."],[["l","马龙","Marlon"],["l","吉尔","Gil"]]],[[["f","Quarry.thumb.webp",180]],[["l","采石场","The Quarry"]],["A large area beyond the broken bridge where stone and ore deposits are generated each day. It is unlocked upon completion of the ",["l","收集包#Crafts Room","Crafts Room Bundles"]," in the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"]," or purchasing \"Bridge\" from the ",["l","Joja社区发展申请书","Joja Community Development Form"]," for 25,000g. The entrance to the ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"]," is located here."],[]]]]]],["Foraging",2,[["g",[["MountainForageLocations.thumb.webp",320,["Locations at the Mountain where forageable items can spawn."],"MountainForageLocations.webp"]]],["p",[["l","采集","Forageable"]," items found on the ground in the Mountain are:"]],["l",0,[[1,["In ",["l","春季","Spring"],": ",["i","(O)20","Leek"]," (58%), and ",["i","(O)16","Wild Horseradish"]," (42%)"]],[1,["In ",["l","夏季","Summer"],": ",["i","(O)398","Grape"]," (62%), and ",["i","(O)396","Spice Berry"]," (38%)"]],[1,["In ",["l","秋季","Fall"],": ",["i","(O)408","Hazelnut"]," (53%), ",["i","(O)404","Common Mushroom"]," (24%), and ",["i","(O)406","Wild Plum"]," (24%)"]],[1,["In ",["l","冬季","Winter"],": ",["i","(O)418","Crocus"]," (40%), ",["i","(O)414","Crystal Fruit"]," (38%), and ",["i","(O)283","Holly"]," (22%)"]]]],["p",["Forageable items spawn at an average rate of 0.5 per night. The map shows the possible locations as red and magenta tiles; when the original trees are present, the magenta tiles have a 90% smaller chance of spawning items because they are identified as being behind the original trees."]]]],["Artifact Spots",2,[["p",[["l","古物","Artifacts"]," that can be found by digging up ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s at the Mountain are:"]],["l",0,[[1,[["i","(O)581","Prehistoric Skull"]," (0.6% + 3-6%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)112","Rusty Cog"]," (4%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)120","Prehistoric Handaxe"]," (3%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)103","Ancient Doll"]," (3%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)115","Prehistoric Tool"]," (2%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)589","Trilobite"]," (1.8%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)101","Arrowhead"]," (1.6%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)105","Chewing Stick"]," (1.5%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)119","Bone Flute"]," (0.7%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)114","Ancient Seed"]," (0.7%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)587","Amphibian Fossil"]," (0.6%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)109","Ancient Sword"]," (0.6%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)107","Dinosaur Egg"]," (0.6%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)126","Strange Doll (green)"]," (0.06%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)127","Strange Doll (yellow)"]," (0.06%)"]]]],["p",["Other possible items are:"]],["l",0,[[1,["1-3 ",["i","(O)330","Clay"]," (14-29%)"]],[1,[["i","(O)102","Lost Book"]," (20% + 3-7%); once all Lost Books have been found, any potential Lost Book is replaced by ",["i","(O)770","Mixed Seeds"],"."]],[1,["Only in ",["l","冬季","Winter"],": ",["i","(O)412","Winter Root"]," (18%)"]],[1,["Only in ",["l","冬季","Winter"],": ",["i","(O)416","Snow Yam"]," (12%)"]],[1,["1-3 ",["i","(O)390","Stone"]," (5-10%)"]],[1,["1-3 ",["i","(O)378","Copper Ore"]," (2.5-5%)"]],[1,["1-3 ",["i","(O)382","Coal"]," (1.8-4%)"]],[1,["Only in ",["l","春季","Spring"],": 2-5 ",["i","(O)273","Rice Shoot"],"s (4%)"]],[1,["An unseen ",["i","(O)79/1","Secret Note"],": up to 3% chance, only if the player has a ",["l","放大镜","Magnifying Glass"],"."]]]],["p",["Artifact spots spawn at an average rate of 0.4 per night, except in winter when the average rate increases to 0.9 per night."]]]],["Fishing",2,[["g",[["MountainLakeFishingZones.webp",320,[["l","钓鱼#Distance from Land","Distances from land"]," in the Mountain Lake."]]]],["p",["A large lake containing many types of ",["l","鱼","fish"]," fills the middle of the Mountain map. The ",["l","鲤鱼","Carp"]," found here are particularly easy to catch, making the lake a good location to practice ",["l","钓鱼","fishing"]," early in the game. A ",["l","鱼#Legendary Fish","Legendary Fish"],", the ",["l","传说之鱼","Legend"],", is also found here, as well as the ",["l","传说之鱼二代","Legend II"],", one of the five ",["l","鱼#Legendary Fish II","legendary fish II"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Fish"]},{"h":1,"v":["Location"]},{"h":1,"v":["Time"]},{"h":1,"v":["Weather"]}],[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":["Spring"]}],[[["i","(O)136","Largemouth Bass"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)700","Bullhead"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)142","Carp"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)702","Chub"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)153","Green Algae"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":["Summer"]}],[[["i","(O)136","Largemouth Bass"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)138","Rainbow Trout"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Sun"]],[[["i","(O)698","Sturgeon"]],[],["6:00–19:00"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)700","Bullhead"]],[],["Any time"],["Any"]],[[["i","(O)142","Carp"]],[],["A